+  ``violation_error_code`` argument of :class:`.CheckConstraint` and
+  :class:`.UniqueConstraint` allow customizing the ``code`` of
+  ``ValidationError`` raised by :meth:`.BaseConstraint.validate`.
+
 Requests and Responses
 ~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~
 
